+| `src/features/feature_engineering.py` | `text` / `image` subcommands: run a frozen encoder once and write a cache; `pool_text_features` (`first_token` / `mean_pooling`) |
+| `src/features/cache.py` | validate text and image caches (counts, IDs and order, labels, dims, NaN/inf, SHA-256, provenance) |
+| `src/data/loader.py` | joint loader: validates every needed cache, joins on `sample_id` |
+| `src/data/preprocess.py` | `[NO_TEXT]`, RGB conversion, tokenization (shared by extraction and serving) |
+| `src/models/multimodal_classifier.py` | `FusionHead`, `MultimodalClassifier`, `load_fusion_head` |
+| `src/models/trainer.py` | the training loop for every head, README 6 outputs |
+| `src/evaluation/evaluate.py` | checkpoint replay / test scoring (image and multimodal heads) |
+| `src/evaluation/end_to_end.py` | cached path == raw-input path |
+| `src/evaluation/review_samples.py`, `results_report.py` | manual-review grid and CSV; report statistics and figures |
+| `src/serving/predictor.py`, `app.py` | inference wrapper (+ smoke test) and the FastAPI service |
+| `configs/train/multimodal_*.yaml`, `configs/deploy/serving.yaml` | settings |
+| `scripts/compare_feature_caches.py`, `scripts/convert_openai_clip_to_hf.py`, `scripts/summarize_multimodal_runs.py`, `scripts/check_tf32_emulation.py` | cache comparison, offline CLIP, run table, TF32 check |
